ModuleProductPlusName = Product card
ModuleProductPlusDesc = Quick product card: search by ref, label or barcode and modify the main data of the product
Module958800Name = Product card
Module958800Desc = Quick product card: search by ref, label or barcode and modify the main data of the product
ProductPlusDescription = Quick product card: search by ref, label or barcode and modify the main data of the product
ProductPlusDescriptionLong = <p>Menu <strong>Products &gt; Product card</strong>, for the users with the permission <em>Use the product card</em> (the administrators get it when the module is enabled). Every change also needs the matching native permission of Products, Categories, Suppliers or Stock.</p><p>Type or scan the ref, the label or the barcode of the product. On the card, every field has its pencil <em>Modify</em>: ref, label, barcode, description, categories, selling price, purchase price (cost price and supplier prices) and stock by warehouse.</p>
